        "TileImage": "$($repository 2ab07903-e958-4af6-b01c-b62058745ce1).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 47 loves riding motorcycles, and he&apos;s tried desperately to join Berlin&apos;s local biker gang. His efforts are being thwarted by two of his ex-colleagues, and the head of the biker gang, Sebastian Kaiser. Time to eliminate these obstacles, so Agent 47 can finally join the gang! Make a firm impression, by battle axe! Agent Rhodes can be dealt with in any way, because he&apos;s not that big of a deal really. Good luck!",
